---
title: Dill Dip
author: Judy White
category: Appetizers & Dips
source: Loving Memories of Mildred
---

@sour cream{1%sm carton}
@mayonnaise{1%Tbsp}
@beau monde seasoning{1/2%Tbsp}
@chopped parsley{1%tsp}
@minced dry onion{1/2%Tbsp}
@dry dill weed{1%tsp}

Mix ingredients well and store in refrigerator.
